{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03836","headline":"蒲津迎驾 · 宋璟","name":"蒲津迎驾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"回銮下蒲坂，飞斾指秦京。\n雒上黄云送，关中紫气迎。\n霞朝看马色，月晓听鸡鸣。\n防拒连山险，长桥压水平。\n省方知化洽，察俗觉时清。\n天下长无事，空余襟带名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋璟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}